  "(1) 任何发明 如 — — (a) 是新颖的； (b) 包含创造性；及 (c) 能作工业应用， 即属可享专利。",
  "(1) An invention is patentable if it— (a) is new; (b) involves an inventive step; and (c) is susceptible of industrial application.",

