  "(4) 每一上述请求亦须符合本条例就以一种法定语文或兼以两种法定语文提供资料或将文件翻译成一种或两种法定语文的译本所订的规定。",
  "(4) Every such request shall also comply with the requirements of this Ordinance as to the provision of information in, or the translation of documents into, one or both official languages.",

